#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Load shedding is the practice of detecting service overload and rejecting "
"requests.\n"
"By rejecting requests when overloaded, load shedding keeps the application "
"alive.\n"
"With priority load shedding, the application even keeps working, albeit in a "
"degraded state: only a fraction of requests is handled, others are rejected "
"early.\n"
"You should consider using it if your application runs in a dynamic "
"environment with a real risk of getting overloaded and is not fronted by "
"another service that sheds load already."
msgstr ""
"负载分流是指检测服务过载并拒绝请求的做法。通过在过载时拒绝请求，负载分流能确保应用程序保持运行。采用优先级负载分流时，应用程序甚至能在性能降级状态下继续运行：仅处理其中一部分请求，其余请求则会被提前拒绝。 "
"如果您的应用程序运行在动态环境中，且确实存在过载的风险，同时前面没有其他服务负责进行负载分流，那么您应该考虑使用该机制。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In Quarkus, the `quarkus-load-shedding` extension provides a load shedding "
"mechanism."
msgstr "在 Quarkus 中 `，quarkus-load-shedding` 扩展提供了一种负载分流机制。"

msgid ""
"Load shedding answers overload with `503 Service Unavailable`: the "
"application as a whole cannot keep up.\n"
"It does not limit how much a single client may ask for.\n"
"A client that exceeds its own allowance is answered with `429 Too Many "
"Requests` by the xref:http-rate-limit-reference.adoc[HTTP rate limit "
"extension], which can be used together with load shedding."
msgstr ""

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use the load shedding extension"
msgstr "使用限电扩展程序"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To use the load shedding extension, you need to add the `io.quarkus:quarkus-"
"load-shedding` extension to your project:"
msgstr "要使用负载分流扩展，您需要将 `io.quarkus:quarkus-load-shedding` 扩展添加到您的项目中："

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When added, load shedding is enabled.\n"
"It can be disabled by setting `quarkus.load-shedding.enabled` to `false`."
msgstr ""
"添加后，将启用负载分流功能。可通过将 `quarkus.load-shedding.enabled` 设置为 `false` 来禁用该功能。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are 2 variants of load shedding: pure and priority-based.\n"
"Pure load shedding rejects all requests when overload is detected.\n"
"Priority load shedding only rejects a fraction of requests even if overload "
"is detected, based on application-defined criteria.\n"
"By default, priority load shedding is enabled.\n"
"It can be disabled by setting `quarkus.load-shedding.priority.enabled` to "
"`false.`"
msgstr ""
"负载卸载有两种变体：纯卸载和基于优先级的卸载。 "
"纯负载分流在检测到过载时会拒绝所有请求。优先级负载分流即使检测到过载，也会根据应用程序定义的标准仅拒绝部分请求。默认情况下，优先级负载分流处于启用状态。可通过将 "
"`quarkus.load-shedding.priority.enabled` 设置为 `false` 来禁用该功能 `。`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "There are 2 ways of customizing priority load shedding:"
msgstr "自定义优先级限电有以下两种方法："

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By implementing `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestPrioritizer`, the "
"application can decide which requests can be rejected early on and which "
"requests can only be rejected when there's no other choice."
msgstr ""
"通过实现 `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestPrioritizer，` "
"应用程序可以决定哪些请求可以在早期被拒绝，哪些请求只能在别无选择时才被拒绝。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By implementing `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestClassifier`, the "
"application can classify requests into cohorts which are rejected "
"independently."
msgstr ""
"通过实现 `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestClassifier` "
"，应用程序可以将请求分类到不同的组中，这些组将分别被拒绝。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Other configuration options are described below, although they should "
