msgstr "下面将介绍其他配置选项，不过通常情况下应保持这些选项的默认设置不变。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The load shedding algorithm"
msgstr "限电算法"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The load shedding algorithm has 2 parts:"
msgstr "限电算法包括两个部分："

#, fuzzy
msgid "overload detection"
msgstr "过载检测"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "prioritization (optional)"
msgstr "优先级排序（可选）"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Overload detection"
msgstr "过载检测"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To detect whether the current service is overloaded, an adaptation of the "
"Vegas algorithm (known from TCP) is used."
msgstr "为了检测当前服务是否过载，采用了Vegas算法（源自TCP）的变体。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This algorithm starts with a configurable limit of in-flight requests, by "
"default 100.\n"
"If the current number of concurrent in-flight requests reaches the limit, "
"overload situation is signalled."
msgstr "该算法首先设定一个可配置的“处理中请求”上限，默认值为100。如果当前并发处理中请求的数量达到该上限，则会触发过载警报。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"That is not very interesting, but the algorithm dynamically adjusts the "
"limit based on the size of the request queue.\n"
"If the queue is short, more requests can be handled and the limit increases; "
"if the queue is long, fewer requests can be handled and the limit decreases.\n"
"The limit cannot increase or decrease indefinitely; there's a configurable "
"minimum, by default 20, and configurable maximum, by default 1000."
msgstr ""
"这虽然不太有趣，但该算法会根据请求队列的大小动态调整限制值。如果队列较短，则可处理的请求更多，限制值随之增加；如果队列较长，则可处理的请求较少，限制值随之减少。 "
"该限制值不能无限增加或减少；它有一个可配置的最小值（默认值为 20）和一个可配置的最大值（默认值为 1000）。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There's no actual queue of requests that we could monitor, though, so the "
"algorithm estimates the current length of a request queue based on "
"previously seen response times.\n"
"The longer recent requests take, compared to the recent lowest response "
"time, the longer the queue is supposed to be."
msgstr ""
"不过，实际上并没有我们可以监控的请求队列，因此该算法会根据之前观察到的响应时间来估算当前请求队列的长度。与最近的最低响应时间相比，如果近期请求的耗时越长，则推测队列就越长。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Prioritization"
msgstr "优先级排序"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "If an overload situation is signalled, prioritization is invoked."
msgstr "如果检测到过载情况，则会触发优先级机制。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If prioritization is disabled, all requests beyond the current limit are "
"rejected immediately.\n"
"However, by default, prioritization is enabled, which means a request is "
"only rejected if the overload is deep enough."
msgstr ""
"如果禁用了优先级设置，则所有超出当前限制的请求都会被立即拒绝。不过，默认情况下，优先级设置是启用的，这意味着只有当过载程度足够严重时，请求才会被拒绝。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The overload depth is expressed as a number between 0.0 and 1.0.\n"
"It is 0.0 when the number of current requests is at the current limit.\n"
"When the number of current requests exceeds the current limit, the result "
"scales smoothly using the right half of a sigmoid curve (hyperbolic tangent)."
"\n"
"This provides maximum initial steepness to aggressively shed lower-priority "
"requests immediately upon crossing the limit, while smoothly flattening out "
"near 1.0 to provide a broad runway for higher-priority traffic.\n"
"When the limit is below the maximum limit, the overload depth reaches 1.0 "
"when the number of current requests reaches the maximum limit.\n"
"When the limit is at the maximum limit, the overload depth reaches 1.0 when "
"the number of current requests reaches 130% of the maximum limit, leaving a "
"30% safety buffer for the most important requests."
msgstr ""
"过载深度用0.0到1.0之间的数值表示。当当前请求数量达到当前限制时，该数值为0."
"0。当当前请求数量超过当前限制时，结果会沿S型曲线（双曲正切函数）的右半部分平滑变化。 "
"这种设计在刚超过限制时提供最大的初始陡度，以立即果断地舍弃优先级较低的请求，同时在接近 1.0 "
"时平滑地趋于平缓，为优先级更高的流量提供宽裕的处理空间。当限制值低于最大限制时，当前请求数量达到最大限制时，过载深度即达到 1.0。 "
"当限制值设为最大限制值时，当当前请求数量达到最大限制值的 130% 时，过载深度将达到 1.0，从而为最重要的请求保留 30% 的安全缓冲空间。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The more requests are admitted past the limit, the deeper the overload and "
"the more requests are rejected, until the application settles at a level of "
"concurrency it can sustain."
msgstr "超过限额的请求越多，过载程度就越严重，被拒绝的请求也就越多，直到应用程序稳定在它能够维持的并发水平上。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To determine whether a request should be rejected, 2 attributes are "
"considered:"
msgstr "在确定是否应拒绝某项请求时，会考虑以下两个属性："

#, fuzzy
msgid "request priority"
msgstr "请求优先级"

#, fuzzy
msgid "request cohort"
msgstr "请求队列"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are 5 statically defined priorities and 128 cohorts, which amounts to "
"640 request groups in total."
msgstr "共有 5 个静态定义的优先级和 128 个分组，共计 640 个请求组。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After both priority and cohort are assigned to a request, a request group "
"number is computed.\n"
"The group number is smaller for higher priority requests and higher for "
"lower priority requests.\n"
"If the group number is lower than a threshold derived from the overload "
"depth, the request is accepted, otherwise it is rejected."
msgstr ""
"在为一个请求分配了优先级和组别后，会计算出一个请求组号。优先级越高的请求，其组号越小；优先级越低的请求，其组号越大。如果该组号小于根据过载深度得出的阈值，则接受该请求；否则，该请求将被拒绝。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The threshold is derived as `(1 - overload^3) * 640`, where `overload` is "
"the overload depth (described above) and 640 is the number of request groups "
"(also described above).\n"
"The cubic curve is chosen deliberately, because it is flat near 0, so that a "
"slight excess over the concurrency limit only rejects the least important "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"该阈值的计算公式为 `(1 - 过载^3) * 640，` `其中“过载”指过载` 深度（如上所述），640 指请求组数量（同样如上所述）。 "
"特意选择三次曲线，是因为它在0附近较为平缓，这样即使并发量略微超过限制，也只会拒绝优先级最低的请求。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Customizing request priority"
msgstr "自定义请求优先级"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Priority is assigned by a `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestPrioritizer`.\n"
"There is 5 statically defined priorities in the `io.quarkus.load.shedding."
"RequestPriority` enum: `CRITICAL`, `IMPORTANT`, `NORMAL`, `BACKGROUND` and "
"`DEGRADED`.\n"
"By default, if no request prioritizer applies, the priority is assumed to be "
"`NORMAL`.\n"
"Further, there's a special priority level called `NEVER`, which is exempt "
"from load shedding entirely."
msgstr ""
"优先级由 `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestPrioritizer` 进行分配。 `io.quarkus.load."
"shedding.RequestPriority` 枚举中定义了 5 个静态优先级： `CRITICAL` 、 `IMPORTANT` 、 "
"`NORMAL` 、 `BACKGROUND` 和 `DEGRADED` 。 默认情况下，如果没有应用任何请求优先级器，则优先级默认为 `NORMAL` "
"。此外，还有一个名为 `NEVER 的` 特殊优先级级别，该级别完全不受负载削减机制的影响。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is one default prioritizer which assigns the priority of `NEVER` to "
"requests to the non-application endpoints.\n"
"It declares no `@Priority`."
msgstr ""
"有一个默认优先级分配器，它会将 `“NEVER”` 优先级分配给针对非应用程序端点的请求。该分配器未声明任何 `@Priority` 注解。"

msgid ""
"Independently of priority load shedding, the health probes (liveness, "
"readiness and startup) and the metrics endpoint are never shed, even if "
"priority load shedding is disabled.\n"
"Extensions declare such paths with the `io.quarkus.vertx.http.deployment.spi."
"ControlPlanePathBuildItem` build item from the `quarkus-vertx-http-"
"deployment-spi` artifact."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is possible to define custom implementations of the `RequestPrioritizer` "
"interface.\n"
"The implementations must be CDI beans, otherwise they are ignored.\n"
"The CDI rules of typesafe resolution must be followed.\n"
"That is, if multiple implementations exist with a different `@Priority` "
"value and some of them are ``@Alternative``s, only the alternatives with the "
"highest priority value are retained.\n"
"If no implementation is an alternative, all implementations are retained and "
"are sorted in descending `@Priority` order (highest priority value comes "
"first)."
msgstr ""
"可以定义 `RequestPrioritizer` 接口的自定义实现。这些实现必须是 CDI Bean，否则将被忽略。必须遵循 CDI "
"的类型安全解析规则。也就是说，如果存在多个具有不同 `@Priority` 值的实现，且其中部分是 `@Alternatives` "
"，则仅保留优先级最高的替代方案。 如果没有实现是替代项，则保留所有实现，并按 `@Priority` 值从高到低排序（优先级最高的值排在最前面）。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Customizing request cohort"
msgstr "自定义请求群体"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Cohort is assigned by a `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestClassifier`.\n"
"There are 128 statically defined cohorts, with the lowest number being 0 and "
"the highest number being 127.\n"
"The classifier should return a number in this interval; if it doesn't, the "
"result is clamped by a simple bit mask.\n"
"This puts requirements on the returned value that are described in the "
"`RequestClassifier` javadoc."
msgstr ""
"队列由 `io.quarkus.load.shedding.RequestClassifier` 分配。 共有 128 个静态定义的群组，编号范围从 0 "
"到 127。分类器应返回该区间内的一个数字；若未返回，则通过简单的位掩码对结果进行裁剪。这会对返回值提出相应要求，具体说明请参见 "
"`RequestClassifier 的` Javadoc 文档。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There is one default classifier which assigns a cohort based on a hash of "
"the remote IP address and current time, such that an IP address changes its "
"cohort roughly every hour.\n"
"It declares no `@Priority`."
msgstr ""
"有一个默认分类器，它根据远程 IP 地址的哈希值和当前时间来分配用户群组，使得一个 IP 地址大约每小时更换一次用户群组。该分类器未声明 "
"`@Priority` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is possible to define custom implementations of the `RequestClassifier` "
